        "es": "Puede alcanzar a Pokémon de tipo Fantasma con movimientos de tipo Normal o Lucha.",
        "en": "This Pokémon ignores Ghost-type Pokémon's immunity to Normal- and Fighting-type moves. Ghost Pokémon's other types affect damage as usual."
      }
    }
